{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p004807","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p004807"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p004807","label":"守者吏未名（呂不韋列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"守者吏","mention_ids":["c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0036"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0036","chapter_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p006","quote":"守者吏"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0036","start":36,"end":39,"surface":"守者吏","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004807","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p006","chapter_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji085-018","person_id":"cbr-p004807","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-085-lubuwei"],"status":"contextual_provisional","rationale":"依子楚歸秦、孝文莊襄王序與太子政立王的句群暫接，子政母未補姓名，四公子並列不作同時在世證據；養母與真母、仲父號稱各分存。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["守者吏"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p006","quote":"秦昭王五十年，使王齮圍邯鄲，急，趙欲殺子楚。子楚與呂不韋謀，行金六百斤予守者吏，得脫，亡赴秦軍，遂以得歸。趙欲殺子楚妻子，子楚夫人趙豪家女也，得匿，以故母子竟得活。秦昭王五十六年，薨，太子安國君立為王，華陽夫人為王后，子楚為太子。趙亦奉子楚夫人及子政歸秦。"}]}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:p006","text":"秦昭王五十年，使王齮圍邯鄲，急，趙欲殺子楚。子楚與呂不韋謀，行金六百斤予守者吏，得脫，亡赴秦軍，遂以得歸。趙欲殺子楚妻子，子楚夫人趙豪家女也，得匿，以故母子竟得活。秦昭王五十六年，薨，太子安國君立為王，華陽夫人為王后，子楚為太子。趙亦奉子楚夫人及子政歸秦。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"秦昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004791","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"王齮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004800","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-085-lubuwei:m006-0019","start":19,"e